### 1. Save Your AI Configuration (e.g., Gemini)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/models
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "9f4217bf-42dc-44bd-9276-dd1297b54460",
  "name": "gemini-1.5-flash",
  "apiKey": "AIzaSyARX3igaMInGXeFdhCXhfeDnSPRQf18ghI"
}

> {%
    // Save the Model ID for the chat request
    client.global.set("modelId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. Create a New Conversation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "9f4217bf-42dc-44bd-9276-dd1297b54460",
  "title": "My End-to-End AI Test"
}

> {%
    // Save the Conversation ID for the message request
    client.global.set("conversationId", response.body.id);
%}

### 3. Send a Message to the AI!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "9f4217bf-42dc-44bd-9276-dd1297b54460",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "modelId": "{{modelId}}",
  "content": "In one short sentence, what is the best thing about the Kotlin programming language?",
  "senderType": "user"
}
